Sure, English example is not fine.
But Navajo=20
<http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Navajo_language#yi-.2Fbi-_Alternation_.28Anim=
acy.29>for=20
instance has the following hierarchy.

*humans/lightning =E2=86=92 infants/big animals =E2=86=92 med-size animals =
=E2=86=92 small animals=20
=E2=86=92 insects =E2=86=92 natural forces =E2=86=92 inanimate objects/plan=
ts =E2=86=92 abstractions*
Therefore, lightning is somewhat za'e su'unai.

